// Cairn as a recipe (CR8, 20 §12): the official kit, looks on the heavy humanoid build.
// A weathered earth-warden: antlers, a mossy stone mantle, a green cloak and a staff.
// The kit is a copy of crates/mftr-sim/champions/cairn.ron (a test checks they match); the
// hand-made model in this folder stays what the game shows until the owner prefers this one.
// Cairn: Warden: tank and protector (melee).
// Warden: slows to peel, a shield for an ally, a delayed root, and a delayed knock-up around
// itself to hold a choke.
// Numbers are *(start)* values. Stats are level 1 and gain `growth` each level (02 §1); ability
// numbers are rank 1, and `per_rank` adds to them each rank (M2 slice 2). Durations are in
// milliseconds. The format is in `crates/mftr-sim/src/data.rs`.
